    "body": "Make both `accuse_ken` second-round preparations produce one real tactical payoff inside the first incoming argument battle.\n\n- `Принять реванш` exposes one exactly-once `Сменить ответы` action before defense selection\n- the action replaces the visible three defenses with another canonical set and persists the full safe defense objects, not unstable generated IDs\n- the exact replacement set survives refresh and remains selectable through `battle._defenseChoices`\n- `Потребовать свидетеля` automatically reveals Райхан's first attack color exactly once\n- unused public-rematch payoff expires when the bridge battle finishes\n- both modes require the stable Stage 7 bridge ID and exact bridge battle ID\n- ordinary battles, canonical argument data, conflict core, settlement, and economy remain unchanged\n- source/docs mirrors and cache markers stay synchronized\n\nValidation:\n- implementation run `31062842850` PASS\n- persisted-snapshot repair run `31063239777` PASS\n- focused dynamic public-rematch/witness/resume/expiry/ordinary-battle harness\n- destroy/load localStorage recovery of the exact three canonical defense objects\n- full Stage 7 regression matrix including Stage 7.9\n- source/docs parity, Node syntax, and `git diff --check`\n- exact eleven-file scope\n- no conflict-core/API/economy/arguments/data/system mutation\n- no network transmission",
